@startuml Sales Dashboard

title Quy Trình Xem Dashboard Bán Hàng

actor "Sale Staff" as SaleStaff
participant "Giao Diện\nDashboard" as DashboardUI
participant "SalesController" as SalesCtrl
database "Database" as DB
participant "Order Model" as OrderModel
participant "OrderDetail Model" as OrderDetailModel
participant "Chart.js" as ChartJS

== Xem Dashboard Bán Hàng ==

SaleStaff -> DashboardUI: Truy cập trang dashboard
activate DashboardUI

DashboardUI -> SalesCtrl: dashboard()
activate SalesCtrl

SalesCtrl -> OrderModel: whereDate('orders.created_at', Carbon::today())
activate OrderModel
OrderModel -> DB: SELECT SUM(order_details.cost * order_details.quantity) \nFROM orders JOIN order_details \nWHERE DATE(orders.created_at) = CURDATE() \nAND orders.status = 'delivery'
DB --> OrderModel: Doanh thu hôm nay
deactivate OrderModel

SalesCtrl -> OrderModel: whereBetween('orders.created_at', [Carbon::now()->startOfWeek(), Carbon::now()])
activate OrderModel
OrderModel -> DB: SELECT SUM(order_details.cost * order_details.quantity) \nFROM orders JOIN order_details \nWHERE orders.created_at BETWEEN [start_of_week] AND [now] \nAND orders.status = 'delivery'
DB --> OrderModel: Doanh thu tuần này
deactivate OrderModel

SalesCtrl -> OrderModel: whereYear, whereMonth
activate OrderModel
OrderModel -> DB: SELECT SUM(order_details.cost * order_details.quantity) \nFROM orders JOIN order_details \nWHERE YEAR(orders.created_at) = YEAR(CURDATE()) \nAND MONTH(orders.created_at) = MONTH(CURDATE()) \nAND orders.status = 'delivery'
DB --> OrderModel: Doanh thu tháng này
deactivate OrderModel

SalesCtrl -> OrderModel: whereYear
activate OrderModel
OrderModel -> DB: SELECT SUM(order_details.cost * order_details.quantity) \nFROM orders JOIN order_details \nWHERE YEAR(orders.created_at) = YEAR(CURDATE()) \nAND orders.status = 'delivery'
DB --> OrderModel: Doanh thu năm này
deactivate OrderModel

SalesCtrl --> DashboardUI: Trả về view với dữ liệu thống kê
deactivate SalesCtrl

DashboardUI -> ChartJS: Khởi tạo biểu đồ doanh thu
activate ChartJS
ChartJS --> DashboardUI: Hiển thị biểu đồ
deactivate ChartJS

DashboardUI --> SaleStaff: Hiển thị dashboard với số liệu thống kê
deactivate DashboardUI

@enduml
